window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>AJ Moore has a score to settle, and with her future at stake, she’s ready to walk back into the fog in search of the only person who can make her whole.</p> <p>AJ has come a long way from the simple reporter caught up in the mystery of the stones. She’s a warrior who refuses to leave a man behind - particularly the one who has captured her heart.</p> <p>There’s more at stake than finding one man. Their enemy has discovered the magic of the Heart Stone. And if AJ and Finn are to ever meet, they must see the Heart Stone is once again safe in the hands of the Keepers. And the only way to protect the Heart Stone, and secure their future, is to seek the help of the one person who everyone else believes betrayed them.</p>"; 
